# Copy this file to ".env" and fill in the value below.
#
# 1. Go to https://formspree.io and create a free account.
# 2. Create a new form and set its destination email to jbaldac02@gmail.com.
# 3. Formspree gives you a form ID (the part after https://formspree.io/f/).
#    Paste it here.
# 4. If deploying to Vercel/Netlify, add the same variable in the project's
#    environment variable settings so the live site picks it up too.
#
# Until this is set, the /contact page shows a plain mailto fallback instead
# of the form.
VITE_FORMSPREE_ID=
